{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_title", "source_sha256": "0b65cf459345f9384ffe3c07c5c82a043f4f348730b679906f0a612d4a14e054", "ja": "心をひとつに！", "zh": "团结一心！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_synopsis", "source_sha256": "26467094a47db9066fd3432249743606aeef3c4f042077ec699a97e7cc209426", "ja": "レッスン1時間前から自主練していた響に\nプロデューサーはレッスンが厳しい理由を\n尋ねる。「自信を持ってほしい」自主練に\n集まっていたメンバーはそれを知り、感動。\nおにぎりとお菓子で、心をひとつにする。", "zh": "响在训练的一小时前就在自主练习，\n当制作人询问她严格训练大家的理由，得到的\n答案是「希望大家变得更有自信」。\n提前集合来自主练习的其他人闻言相当感动。\n众人一起享用饭团跟点心，彼此团结一心。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1000_se", "source_sha256": "42fbc39f3643893ef62597c479f21af3fae3dc7ec3dc0bc0144b6eff6a5f8910", "ja": "キュッキュッキュ！", "zh": "咚咚咚！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1001_p", "source_sha256": "ab696685472759ee61d4ccb01178ec26ba384a5150096361590ad4e28f5efa4e", "ja": "（……ん？　レッスン室から、音がするな。\nこの時間、予定は入ってないはずだけど……）", "zh": "（……嗯？有声音从练习室里传出来呢。\n我记得现在这个时间应该没有人预约使用……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1002_013hib", "source_sha256": "edfe0ecc586bf4c8bcb5edf29907b01c834c8a8ee18b71c38063230e98bc365a", "ja": "ふぅ……。今のはいい感じだったぞ！\nもう1回やろっと！", "zh": "呼……刚刚的感觉很棒喔！\n再做一次吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1003_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1004_013hib", "source_sha256": "0618063fc2ed17974e100cdc892077bddcef9e0c232747a4e50611c9da5f7e51", "ja": "あっ、{$P$}！\nお疲れさま！", "zh": "啊，{$P$}！\n辛苦了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1005_p", "source_sha256": "0ae9a7875f72ad208a9d92c1f9d66b0bcd2b467eb9b87e47620a18bc0c7a2b27", "ja": "誰かと思えば、響か。ずいぶん早いんだな。\nレッスンの時間まで、まだ1時間もあるのに。", "zh": "我还在想是谁，原来是响啊，你来得真早。\n离训练时间还有一小时呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1006_013hib", "source_sha256": "0752f96ffb958966a891018296197a9c4455187e169d745da15ae6104b8f9323", "ja": "もっとカンペキになるために、自主練してたんだっ！\n自分、みんなのお手本にならないといけないしね！", "zh": "本人在自主练习，为了表演得更加完美！\n毕竟本人要做大家的榜样嘛！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1007_p", "source_sha256": "dedc7fbe257a2212531f7ef3102390070a90471c810d726cfb502bf3d40ecbc0", "ja": "そうか、感心だな。それはそうと、ちょうどよかった。\n響に、聞いておきたい事があったんだ。", "zh": "原来如此，真令人佩服。话说回来，你在这里正好。\n我之前就有件事想问你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1008_013hib", "source_sha256": "3cf154197aade065ce7aa142ba77854a164dd0e6598bd15b7667690cd3e5a9db", "ja": "自分に？　なに？", "zh": "问本人吗？什么事？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1009_p", "source_sha256": "043e2379ff2436f9637a4dbb9a910e2ab939570dd14ebc57cfc61f3efb3e6f53", "ja": "最近のみんなとの合同レッスン、かなりハイペース\nじゃないか？　何か理由があるのかと思って。", "zh": "最近跟大家一起上的共同训练课程，\n节奏不是相当紧凑吗？我在想是不是有什么原因。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1010_013hib", "source_sha256": "8c152f8ec36889fb1539c2363c7c8ce6f0c333899c848f59a605ed2f20125c7c", "ja": "なんだ、そのことか～。\nうん、自分も、ちょっと厳しいかもって思ってる。", "zh": "哦，原来是这件事～\n嗯，其实本人也觉得可能有点严格。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1011_013hib", "source_sha256": "f6e58dd27ed5e4be3689535a39aaddc1633b9c9c1f99fe17f22c37592ad341c3", "ja": "けど自分は、みんなに自信を持ってほしいんだっ！\n特に、奈緒にね！", "zh": "不过本人希望大家可以对自己更有自信！\n特别是奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1012_p", "source_sha256": "689c6a9c7596ca30a37ce7056a6b2ee1a76182b54d56e88706af5730e31a973c", "ja": "奈緒に？", "zh": "奈绪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1013_013hib", "source_sha256": "1a787a6447860b56b042993223c0e8ad5ec0405a52a221acdfbf4f05eea4eb35", "ja": "うん。奈緒って、自分と似てるとこあるからさ。\n地方から出てきてるとか、にーにーがいるとか。", "zh": "嗯。因为奈绪跟本人有许多相似之处啊。\n像是来自外县市，以及都有哥哥之类的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1014_013hib", "source_sha256": "3763caa21a842b835f169b6aedb31aefd7fe6689b6efbdb6b69c80836623403a", "ja": "地元を離れるのって、すっごく寂しいでしょ？\nそれに、心配なこともいっぱいあると思うんだ。", "zh": "离开老家不是很寂寞吗？\n而且也会心生许多不安吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1015_013hib", "source_sha256": "be0b42d3ed30455af507e555e605ab0e9d8043b90eb5babcfe49405c35a4d2ef", "ja": "自分ホントに、トップアイドルになれるのかなーとか。\nその前に、アイドルやっていけるのかな、とかさ！", "zh": "像是自己真的能成为顶尖偶像吗？或是更基本的问题，\n自己能不能做得下去偶像这份工作，之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1016_p", "source_sha256": "71ba76fd657298e611c0feb94ca1f9980a06d2f43db64c409328aca06da4d760", "ja": "響……。", "zh": "响……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1017_013hib", "source_sha256": "505aa7ee9523f52935b6707c2831298c448372de29e44d65b863641deb52ba9a", "ja": "うん。でもね、アイドルとしてちゃんと成長すれば、\nそういう不安は、だんだんなくなっていくんだっ。", "zh": "嗯，不过啊，只要在偶像这条路上稳健成长，\n这种不安也会慢慢消失的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1018_013hib", "source_sha256": "56e2ba2ba6a6af63089eff84aaf11b8ddda410a0ae4017699e97332d5813aa15", "ja": "そのためにも、自信が必要なんだぞ！\nだから自分、みんなに自信をつけたいんだ！", "zh": "而自信对成长来说是必要的喔！\n所以本人希望让大家更有自信！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1019_p", "source_sha256": "ae09f8bf5e56ff36ae17909af45917caefa097eaec3e58ccd415d77f03ecbe7b", "ja": "なるほど。響は奈緒達のために、\n色々考えてくれたんだな。", "zh": "原来如此。\n响替奈绪她们设想了很多呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1020_013hib", "source_sha256": "37269e6989bb981649bb099c3107e81dcc3431bb3b4dd2ba73d59c57ae850e68", "ja": "えへへっ、トーゼンさー。\nだって、自分達みんな、家族だからね！", "zh": "嘿嘿，那是当然的啦──\n因为我们都是一家人啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1021_013hib", "source_sha256": "db33bd83c5c9b020a4c90d81507d473eac63d404b68683d1629b0d45820e89d3", "ja": "奈緒は、みんなのことが心配なんだよね。\n自分、奈緒のそういう優しいとこ好きだぞっ！", "zh": "奈绪很为大家担心对吧。\n本人相当喜欢奈绪这种体贴的个性喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1022_013hib", "source_sha256": "f2e17106258b38f42ff76acf74ab45e86842a782348651935bbb84c9cdcdf3d1", "ja": "でも、優しいだけじゃ、\nトップアイドルにはなれない。そうでしょ？", "zh": "不过光靠体贴，\n是无法成为顶尖偶像的，对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1023_013hib", "source_sha256": "e14f96027ada018b497a4aebb6988f0588a7a9ce141434e2b6cffe5ac6708aab", "ja": "それで自分、心をオニにして、\nみんなに厳しくしてるんだ！", "zh": "所以本人才会狠下心，\n严格地训练大家！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1024_p", "source_sha256": "b8bac8371b5c98afe34cf7561e5894bca27bdb39d9254e1ad3d330db3ead4126", "ja": "ああ、響の考えはよくわかったよ。\n優しくて頼りがいのある、いい先輩なんだな。", "zh": "嗯，我了解响的想法了。\n你真是体贴又可靠的好前辈呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1025_013hib", "source_sha256": "1f2fe84051d96c4dcbea3d7d94313cc28bc8fecac547e0e3ad97f8ef6ea7a94e", "ja": "えっ！？　そ、そんなこと……あるけど……。\n……な、なんか照れるぞ～！", "zh": "咦！？是、是这样……没错啦……\n……可、可是你让人有点难为情喔～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1026_se", "source_sha256": "d7f0742f486712cf4a0ae941f2940c5ff5b706f1e8901b366c57f247e3b3cc81", "ja": "ガチャッ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1027_037nao", "source_sha256": "d123f7b5abff6d9aa3a3f332ca62f69c566d4ff1d094eb29ad24b7b70a304bac", "ja": "響～～～！！！", "zh": "响——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1028_013hib", "source_sha256": "e9736098167552068e79b94beaa814d9970aa9e5285e0f7963a4cb3302f8f997", "ja": "奈緒！　それに、みんなも……\nどうしたんだっ！？", "zh": "奈绪！还有大家也在……\n你们怎么来了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1029_014mir", "source_sha256": "74ffaa8ba5b68f81af9efd1edcbb32e28192202e6086200a24ed91281a5c5a40", "ja": "私達、早めにレッスン室に来て、\n4人で練習しようって約束してたんです♪", "zh": "我们四个人之前约好，\n要早点到练习室来练习♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1030_024ann", "source_sha256": "d4c954f1922ad3875a93fc494887800ec8bdd9f6d6ded8984b104c3fc7a2c4cc", "ja": "ちょっとでも……響さんに、\n追いつきたかった……から……。", "zh": "因为我们想……尽量跟上……\n响的脚步……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "58f7399a215065b34b65b56f2943a185143112be243bbca01c61f065b84d2fd0", "ja": "レッスン室に入ろうとしたら、響ちゃん達の声が\n聞こえたから、つい立ち聞きしちゃったの。ゴメンね。", "zh": "正要进练习室的时候，刚好听见你们的声音，\n不小心就待在门外听下去了，真抱歉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1032_013hib", "source_sha256": "9114565716cee4bc8c6e5e2aef6f71b3cfed203e3e21a7543d2addbffe76e7b7", "ja": "ええっ！？　い、今の聞いてたの！？", "zh": "什么！？刚、刚刚的对话你们都听见了！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1033_037nao", "source_sha256": "c2dcca35c1f9f59891af8fa0320e4417b090a9a6847422b38b73a1a6331015b4", "ja": "全部聞かせてもらったで！　響、私らのこと、そんなに\n考えてくれてたんやな……響は最高のセンパイや！", "zh": "全都听见了喔！没想到响这么为我们着想……\n你真是最棒的前辈了啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1034_013hib", "source_sha256": "72d2fef6adce83b52e04d73d06231b188904622a0167de283e4c8ea70333bb3c", "ja": "うぎゃー！　どうしよう{$P$}！？\nこんなの……恥ずかしすぎるー！", "zh": "呜呀──！怎么办啊，{$P$}！？\n这真是……太尴尬了──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1035_p", "source_sha256": "f7649f935b3e8b14e0e5ab81e0e9ab65baa8f7b78930ba77744364e01ba4d3bb", "ja": "心が通じて良かったな、響！", "zh": "大家能了解你的心意真是太好了，响！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1036_013hib", "source_sha256": "480cca9f4704451f58decf88dff24ce2fa06ed5dded13bb0f7182da1aa9df0f9", "ja": "そうじゃなくて！　助けてよー！", "zh": "谁在跟你说这个！救救本人啊──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1037_041fuk", "source_sha256": "261163da9553990576801625c057fe98eda33492b74b73f51291acdd304ca90c", "ja": "響ちゃんは、私達のこと信頼してくれているのよね？\nなら、その信頼に応えなくちゃ！", "zh": "响很信赖我们对吧？\n那么，我们也得回应你的信任才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1038_024ann", "source_sha256": "49ff6811c59717880305e7a683db3f29d53b79386e1eaabce71422728a897861", "ja": "……響さんのレッスン……、厳しいけど……、\n杏奈……最後まで、ついて行くよ……！", "zh": "……响的训练……虽然很严格……\n不过杏奈……会一直跟着你到最后……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1039_014mir", "source_sha256": "e0c0489cfb445538c28329a152b503db6184a389f5a1ff505751ef7fcd41ada5", "ja": "みんなで、もっと、もーっとがんばって、\n楽しいライブにしようね♪", "zh": "大家一起加倍、再加倍地努力，\n来呈现出一场开心的演唱会吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1040_013hib", "source_sha256": "dc90a978ee99fc40346bdec721a079d4c3df3a297bd464c34b0f7252d652c06d", "ja": "みんな……。わかった！\n自分、もう恥ずかしがらない！", "zh": "大家……\n好！本人不再害羞了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1041_013hib", "source_sha256": "b2bfe276238d5abb1d27758a2460ba9a943373355141302409c075d775ec338c", "ja": "みんな、覚悟はいいんだね！\nそれじゃあ、これからしっかり、自分についてきて！", "zh": "大家都做好心理准备了吧！\n那么接下来，要跟紧本人的脚步喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1042_se", "source_sha256": "5f7d79735b4db64a8279c26bdd59aeac3865bfa3ef7a03433b273f4cdadb0922", "ja": "ぐ～……", "zh": "咕噜噜～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1043_013hib", "source_sha256": "24b41f429314117e9601f59690d6782ff818f8b7dd57e74f440367e722c62454", "ja": "はっ……！", "zh": "啊……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1044_037nao", "source_sha256": "b091d1410c1fcb5bd62dcecc24ed7179cb9ad7e5160d0c844bb15a74e027d9bc", "ja": "……今の、響のお腹の音やろ。\nもしかして、ごはん食べてないん？", "zh": "……这个声音，是响的肚子在叫吼。\n你该不会没吃饭吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1045_013hib", "source_sha256": "088719998b14963a6942fa706e79cd90ac0cd9525f8f3f3a7130df73b2f9dce4", "ja": "じ、自分のお腹の音じゃないぞ！？　\nお腹とか、全然空いてないしっ！", "zh": "刚、刚刚不是本人的肚子在叫喔！？\n本人的肚子一点都不饿！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1046_013hib", "source_sha256": "92d856ecba37343976c090fea22c20221b911c4279be6a62a9d68df5e7f7055b", "ja": "今日はちょっと、忙しかったから……\nお昼ごはんが足りなかっただけっ。", "zh": "只是因为今天有点忙……\n午餐吃得不够多。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1047_037nao", "source_sha256": "f529d4d971f232ca6424be4ef635503ba850fc163752f87e70b1c0290847fad4", "ja": "お腹の音ぐらいで、恥ずかしがらんでもええって。\n私、おにぎり持ってきてるけど食べる？", "zh": "不过是肚子叫而已，害羞什么咩。\n我有带饭团过来，要吃吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1048_013hib", "source_sha256": "a26a19286e56494b84e84435aa2c42270a81ba308ac587fc8e11beeb4e464776", "ja": "えっ、いいの！？", "zh": "咦，可以吗！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1049_037nao", "source_sha256": "173d75b5fd8eea6d7e3178d3e9a86fa3f2bc4fe72c513c473ef1e652fa1b7126", "ja": "前にも言うたやろ？　大阪人は優しいねん♪\nいっぱいあるから、みんなも食べる？", "zh": "我之前不是说过吗？大阪人可是很贴心的♪\n我带了很多过来，大家要不要一起吃？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1050_041fuk", "source_sha256": "bf22eb81f88b3524702525668d47f9998c3979f6935bb78584e71d1cf9ebc4b9", "ja": "ありがとう、奈緒ちゃん♪　それじゃお礼に、\nってわけじゃないけど……お菓子をどうぞ♪", "zh": "谢谢你，奈绪♪\n那么，虽然也不算是谢礼……这是点心，请用♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1051_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8a7b228166c90d78f94a860c8face2c333743dd6e88395e904300df669f07899", "ja": "おやつにみんなで食べようかなぁと思って、\nスコーンを焼いてきたの♪　クリームもあるよ。", "zh": "我烤了司康带过来，想说可以让大家当点心吃♪\n也有奶油喔。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1052_014mir", "source_sha256": "6ba3e40bf39d7e4b1e0a73a54e289efc4397eaf4547a0899ec5a908faa8fd13f", "ja": "わぁ、スコーン！？　オシャレですね！\n私、クリーム大好きです♪", "zh": "哇，司康！？好时尚耶！\n我最喜欢奶油了♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1053_014mir", "source_sha256": "7a63a5ceb969aece04ff4fd777c6b6bf6a0d46a06e3b3114ac8b69ff33ebc2fc", "ja": "えっと、私は……あ、あった！\n今日は、アメいっぱい持ってきたんです♪", "zh": "唔，我的话……找、找到了！\n我今天带了很多糖果过来喔♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1054_024ann", "source_sha256": "cb75d0a82dd18caa7e2ccad78387e2ff14e3b7473a993f7e65bcc6aaac18ed25", "ja": "杏奈……ガム……、持ってるよ……。\nこれも食べよう……♪", "zh": "杏奈……带了……口香糖……\n大家也一起吃吧……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1055_p", "source_sha256": "fd2403768ed0dd6840898e209b75e68d59960f1aedf7122c26e566739a4b318e", "ja": "おにぎりとスコーン、アメにガムか。\n食べ合わせが悪い気もするけど……。", "zh": "饭团跟司康，还有糖果跟口香糖啊。\n菜色感觉不是很搭……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1056_037nao", "source_sha256": "688aa622b1ccc600e8655159592e57f04d9348e6fe703f09a2d4bfd649cf73b7", "ja": "みんなで食べれば、そんなん関係ありませんって♪\nさ、食べよ食べよ！　私、ハラペコや！", "zh": "大家一起吃就无所谓了啦♪\n来，快开动快开动！我快饿死了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1057_013hib", "source_sha256": "c19bca5453c4489d87ab9e450ca2635ae6c32a29fde428755e6b47e4433692cc", "ja": "えへへっ、いただきまーす！\n……うん、このおにぎり、おいしいぞ、奈緒！", "zh": "嘿嘿，本人开动啰──！\n……嗯，这个饭团很好吃喔，奈绪！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1058_037nao", "source_sha256": "88e3662cceaeed73e5909fe3b3cfea8d88fcf0a7f06b38a8396fc86c3004e32a", "ja": "せやろ！　アニキ、おにぎり握る才能あんねん。\nゴール決める才能も、ボチボチやけどな！", "zh": "对吧！我老哥很有捏饭团的天分。\n他进球的天分也不差啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1059_014mir", "source_sha256": "26424c4fdf5abd3bae39b94bd9a5fe45ef98bf195cbc90763af91738cd9625aa", "ja": "風花さんのスコーンも、\nとっても、とーってもおいしいです♪", "zh": "风花姊做的司康也\n超级、超～级好吃的♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1060_024ann", "source_sha256": "5a89ee3da2f388b6a9dadbddfb9062563fa85ebf6bd2e7e481513ef62096ee4f", "ja": "杏奈……シフォンケーキ、作れるようになった……。\nでも……それしか、作れない……。", "zh": "杏奈……已经学会怎么做戚风蛋糕了……\n不过……现在也只会做这一种……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1061_024ann", "source_sha256": "3e4ffbeda866a37de8cdcb834e2f9fe395b4e86e694e8cf0404e5a75236233c4", "ja": "こういうお菓子も……、\n作れるように……なりたいな……。", "zh": "杏奈也想学会……\n怎么做……这种点心……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1062_041fuk", "source_sha256": "b17e8d7dfefd1e7eb1b034bec0ba7b586fee1b9fd8095312c8a816becfa93030", "ja": "ふふっ、お菓子作りが好きになったのね、杏奈ちゃん♪\n良かったら、スコーンの作り方教えようか？", "zh": "呵呵，杏奈你喜欢上做点心了呀♪\n不嫌弃的话，我教你怎么做司康吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1063_024ann", "source_sha256": "dbb47765024e9db9cba593c1e33a8cc727e6c44c2bb15b954395706b59474c13", "ja": "ほんと……？　うれしい……。\nありがと……です……♪", "zh": "真的吗……？杏奈好开心……\n谢谢……你……♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1064_p", "source_sha256": "a35e630b67236f7c292d168b0cd14f6319e3a63ff6ce3525034244786e58dacf", "ja": "（レッスンの合間の、おにぎりとお菓子のパーティー。\n不思議だけど、いい時間だったな）", "zh": "（在训练空档时开饭团跟点心派对。\n有点奇妙，不过真是美好的时光呢。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0064_story_05_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0064_story_05_1065_p", "source_sha256": "6d6b6cea349c54b0e6347d1532b1c2ff33d265e464001a987d1d7a683ba893e3", "ja": "（響の本音を知ることで、\n皆の心が一つになれた。そんな気がする）", "zh": "（在其他人了解到响的真实想法后，\n所有成员都团结一心了。我有这种感觉。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
